<rss version="0.92"><channel><item>
            <title>[LU-20534] FLR-EC: Stripe replacement: swapping individual stripes between components</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20534</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;To repair damaged files we are going to need new infrastructure to be able to swap individual stripes between layouts. We already have the capability to swap the full layout between files so we can extend this to the case where we just want to swap a single stripe.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;See &lt;a href="https://wiki.whamcloud.com/spaces/PUB/pages/8554350/Lustre+Design+documents" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://wiki.whamcloud.com/spaces/PUB/pages/8554350/Lustre+Design+documents&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
